      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.4 - Hisham ibn Salim asked Imam Jafar ibn Muhammad Al-Sadiq (as) about a man urinating on a roof, then rain falls on it causing water to drip onto clothes.\nImam (as) said: \"There is no harm in it as long as the water that hits it is more than the urine”."
